OL,3,GNEWSA'More money needed' to keep fire
OL,4,Astations open
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service says it needs more money
OL,7,Ffrom council tax payers if it is to
OL,8,Fkeep operating eight rural stations.
OL,10,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService (DWFRS) had initially proposed
OL,12,Fclosing eight rural fire stations to
OL,13,Fsave money, but the recommendation was
OL,14,Fwithdrawn in June on the condition the
OL,15,Ffire precept of tax bills would
OL,16,Fincrease in April 2027.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34902
