OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1791212180
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'More money needed' to keep fire
OL,4,Astations open
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Alice Elliott, who runs the
OL,7,FSave Our Fire Stations group, said it
OL,8,Fwas a "misconception" the stations had
OL,9,Fbeen saved and that they had to
OL,10,F"continue pushing". Chief Fire Officer
OL,11,FAndy Cole said the service needed #105
OL,12,Fper household a year.
OL,14,FThe BBC has asked the Ministry of
OL,15,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,16,FGovernment for comment.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
